Z||000069||RedOktober||11-09-2001||09:49 PM||||Archie.. What headers are you using, I would like to get the PN if you have it.  Looks much better than the Ram Horns. TIA||||reg||1
Z||000070||pherder||11-09-2001||10:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by RedOktober:<BR><B>Archie.. What headers are you using, I would like to get the PN if you have it.  Looks much better than the Ram Horns. TIA</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They are Sanderson CC90 headers.<P>Best price I have found to date is at:<P><A HREF="http://www.centuryperformance.com/detail.asp?Product_ID=SDH-CC90" TARGET=_blank>Century Performance Center</A><P>Paul||||reg||1
